==English==
{{was wotd|2024|May|24}}

===Etymology===
A reference to a calculation or an idea that occurs to one being jotted down on an available scrap of paper, such as the back of an envelope.<ref>{{R:Collins English Dictionary|pos=adj}}</ref>

